```

```
> > | a |
> > | b |
tail
.
<blockquote>
  <blockquote>
    <table>
      <tbody>
        <tr><td>a</td></tr>
        <tr><td>b</td></tr>
      </tbody>
    </table>
  </blockquote>
</blockquote>
<p>tail</p>
```

```
